<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dae Han buys 12,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dae Han buys 12,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dae Han Flour Mills Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had bought 12,500 tonnes of U.S. wheat from Japanese trading house Kanematsu Corp.  </p>
<p>A Dae Han company official said shipment was set for January 15-February 15 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Details for the results are as follow:</p>
<p>  Type of Wheat	     Tonne	Price/T (FOB)</p>
<p>  Soft White		  4,500	 $166.45</p>
<p>(protein max 10 percent)</p>
<p>  Hard Red Winter	   5,500	 $190.15</p>
<p>  Dark Northern Spring    2,500	 $190.70</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
